cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "QuizWrangler: AI skills for converting question documents into Brightspace import formats"
message: "If you use this skill or adapt it for your institution, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Velthuis
    given-names: Raisa
repository-code: "https://github.com/velthuis/quizwrangler"
abstract: >-
  AI skills that convert unstructured instructor question documents into
  Brightspace CSV files or complete QTI quiz packages. The QTI workflow
  supports mixed question types, random pools, HTML, MathML, and embedded
  images. Includes validators for both output formats.
keywords:
  - Brightspace
  - D2L
  - QTI
  - CSV
  - quiz import
  - question banks
  - assessment authoring
  - generative AI
  - learning management systems
  - faculty development
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-08-11"
version: "1.1.0"
